WEBVTT

01:41.440 --> 01:45.710
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.390 --> 01:50.740
[Episode 28]

02:28.750 --> 02:29.940
Lord Jiuhuo,

02:30.690 --> 02:31.890
forgive me.

02:33.579 --> 02:35.060
I cannot

02:36.280 --> 02:38.740
return to Mount Xuankong with you this time.

03:09.270 --> 03:11.710
Though the fox's physical body is destroyed,

03:11.710 --> 03:13.650
she can still manifest her spirit.

03:15.840 --> 03:17.710
Since you two are so in love,

03:18.560 --> 03:19.800
I

03:20.170 --> 03:22.530
shall let you stay here

03:23.500 --> 03:27.579
and accompany this demon for all eternity.

03:35.670 --> 03:38.310
The ruler of the Beast Kingdom sacrificed Jia Lan,

03:38.310 --> 03:39.430
sealed Jiuhuo,

03:40.180 --> 03:43.240
and ruled the world with the demon-controlling talisman.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.880
He never anticipated that

03:45.230 --> 03:48.560
Jia Lan's primordial soul could absorb the world's hatred.

03:48.560 --> 03:50.800
This power is beyond imagination.

03:56.710 --> 03:59.570
Liars, they're all liars.

04:00.120 --> 04:01.650
They say I'm evil.

04:01.670 --> 04:03.100
But you're even worse.

04:03.880 --> 04:07.830
No one in this world deserves the light.

04:08.780 --> 04:10.260
If that's the case,

04:10.630 --> 04:12.480
why don't I become the darkness?

04:28.000 --> 04:33.130
So this is how hatred feels... so delightful.

04:34.770 --> 04:37.159
I should have done this sooner.

04:38.760 --> 04:41.080
I'm so hungry now.

04:42.010 --> 04:44.159
Where should I go to feed?

04:48.240 --> 04:51.770
Let's go to the Beast Kingdom.

04:53.520 --> 04:56.200
Jia Lan slaughtered the Beast Kingdom overnight.

04:56.200 --> 04:59.409
The unjustly killed souls generated endless resentment.

04:59.409 --> 05:01.640
She absorbed all this hatred into her body.

05:01.640 --> 05:03.480
Her power grew stronger day by day.

05:03.480 --> 05:06.240
She could control not only demons but also humans.

05:06.240 --> 05:08.110
She made them kill each other.

05:08.130 --> 05:11.460
The endless hatred continued to nourish Jia Lan.

05:11.800 --> 05:12.800
And so,

05:12.920 --> 05:15.380
she finally lost herself completely

05:15.690 --> 05:17.490
and became Lady Black Fox.

05:17.800 --> 05:19.730
The Black Fox has no physical body.

05:20.130 --> 05:21.770
She feeds on hatred

05:22.800 --> 05:24.400
and kills wherever she goes.

05:24.630 --> 05:25.920
That's why later,

05:26.080 --> 05:27.890
the Third Young Master of the Aolai Kingdom used all his strength

05:27.890 --> 05:30.220
to keep the Black Fox beyond the Boundary.

05:33.830 --> 05:34.920
Now look over here.

05:36.000 --> 05:37.390
The evil energy under the altar

05:37.390 --> 05:39.920
is from the innocent people sacrificed

05:40.070 --> 05:42.670
by the ruler and Northern Hill Elder back then.

05:44.320 --> 05:47.050
This is the secret you've been trying to cover up.

05:48.250 --> 05:50.710
Control demons and one can rule the world...

05:51.040 --> 05:53.730
Even if all the previous rulers knew this secret,

05:53.730 --> 05:55.080
who would care?

05:55.390 --> 05:56.600
Miss, you're right.

05:56.620 --> 05:59.530
But among the 36 rulers of the Beast Kingdom,

05:59.550 --> 06:02.730
one ruler fell in love with a female demon.

06:02.800 --> 06:04.120
He put all his effort into researching

06:04.120 --> 06:06.590
a way to break the demon-controlling talisman.

06:06.590 --> 06:09.790
And he wrote it down in this secret chamber.

06:11.090 --> 06:12.830
If there's a way to break it,

06:13.270 --> 06:14.400
why didn't he use it?

06:15.010 --> 06:16.490
Once the demon-controlling talisman is broken,

06:16.490 --> 06:18.830
the demons who have long been abused and enslaved

06:18.830 --> 06:20.490
will no longer be restrained.

06:21.040 --> 06:22.770
They'll kill the demon tamers.

06:24.210 --> 06:26.390
The demon race would seek revenge madly.

06:26.390 --> 06:27.390
An eye for an eye,

06:27.890 --> 06:29.070
blood for blood.

06:30.240 --> 06:33.390
There's no turning back on the path of demon-controlling.

06:33.390 --> 06:35.720
So, he could only give up.

06:37.310 --> 06:40.159
Ruler Bumu, your task is heavy and the road is long.

06:40.380 --> 06:42.440
As long as the Black Fox still exists,

06:42.690 --> 06:45.780
the path of demon-controlling will not end.

06:46.630 --> 06:47.190
No.

06:48.100 --> 06:50.000
As long as we eliminate the Black Fox,

06:50.000 --> 06:51.530
everything can be stopped.

06:52.860 --> 06:53.580
Bumu,

06:54.670 --> 06:56.530
I need the names of all the victims

06:56.720 --> 06:58.120
in this mass grave.

07:10.480 --> 07:11.580
Is the medicine ready?

07:11.580 --> 07:12.500
Almost done.

07:12.750 --> 07:13.800
Meng Yun,

07:13.870 --> 07:15.860
who is this cold medicine for?

07:18.570 --> 07:20.010
Miss Dongfang said,

07:20.100 --> 07:21.540
[999 Cold Medicine]

07:20.360 --> 07:22.040
the young master stayed up all night yesterday

07:22.040 --> 07:23.570
and sneezed several times.

07:23.870 --> 07:25.700
Has she accepted him already?

07:39.800 --> 07:42.159
They look good together.

07:44.750 --> 07:47.190
Although Wangquan is good to Huaizhu,

07:47.370 --> 07:49.240
the masked sir is not bad either.

07:53.010 --> 07:54.610
Why are you giving this to me?

07:59.430 --> 08:00.820
When in doubt,

08:02.360 --> 08:04.290
why not consult the will of heaven?

08:05.850 --> 08:08.250
You're not making me count petals, are you?

08:08.750 --> 08:11.240
That's so cliché and boring.

08:11.260 --> 08:13.120
If you don't want it, give it back.

08:19.920 --> 08:21.090
I didn't expect

08:21.120 --> 08:23.520
Qinlan to care so much about me and the mask.

08:24.120 --> 08:25.250
Tell her.

08:26.680 --> 08:27.880
She deserves to know.

08:33.360 --> 08:34.150
Qinlan,

08:34.549 --> 08:35.909
as we're about to part ways,

08:35.909 --> 08:37.120
I have a gift for you.

08:42.870 --> 08:44.240
I can't accept a gift without merit.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.120
I don't want it.

08:48.360 --> 08:49.870
Why don't you take a look first?

08:49.870 --> 08:51.330
Little heroine Dongfang.

09:00.860 --> 09:02.570
Ma... ma... ma...

09:07.320 --> 09:08.240
Sister,

09:08.320 --> 09:10.270
you knew all along, didn't you?

09:13.450 --> 09:16.850
Your sister only found out recently as well.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.270
I feel

09:21.320 --> 09:23.050
the shock isn't big enough yet.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.920
Let me give you a bonus gift.

09:30.440 --> 09:33.440
Good evening, little heroine.

09:33.960 --> 09:36.450
Puppy Li, how dare you bully me too?

09:36.480 --> 09:38.410
Come here! I'll give you a beating!

09:39.730 --> 09:40.670
Stop right there!

09:40.670 --> 09:41.270
Li Quzhuo!

09:41.270 --> 09:42.470
You stop right there!

09:43.020 --> 09:44.240
I'm giving you a way out.

09:44.240 --> 09:46.100
Just chase me a little and quit it.

09:47.370 --> 09:48.980
You sneaky Puppy Li.

09:49.490 --> 09:51.350
I've been your master for so long,

09:51.600 --> 09:53.530
and you didn't let slip even a hint.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.510
You made me agonize over

09:55.550 --> 09:57.150
Wangquan and the masked sir.

09:57.680 --> 09:59.300
Have you no conscience?

10:00.200 --> 10:01.410
Alright.

10:03.000 --> 10:06.070
I'm sorry about that.

10:12.030 --> 10:12.890
How about this,

10:13.720 --> 10:15.270
I can grant you one wish.

10:16.290 --> 10:17.840
Anything?

10:18.200 --> 10:20.660
It has to be reasonable and legal, of course.

10:20.960 --> 10:22.150
But Miss Qinlan,

10:22.150 --> 10:24.510
a well-mannered young lady like you surely

10:24.510 --> 10:25.870
wouldn't make things difficult for me.

10:25.870 --> 10:27.240
How boring.

10:27.750 --> 10:28.790
I bet

10:28.910 --> 10:30.570
you just wanted to lure me away

10:30.630 --> 10:32.150
so Hongye and Huaizhu

10:32.150 --> 10:34.000
can have some alone time.

10:34.150 --> 10:34.870
Look,

10:35.320 --> 10:37.790
this is our last night in the Beast Kingdom.

10:38.240 --> 10:38.910
Why don't we

10:38.910 --> 10:41.040
give them some space to be alone?

10:41.320 --> 10:44.510
Let them pour their hearts out to each other.

10:45.960 --> 10:46.670
Besides,

10:48.360 --> 10:50.760
I have something I want to talk to you about.

10:51.360 --> 10:52.270
What is it?

11:01.700 --> 11:03.480
After all we've been through,

11:03.910 --> 11:06.680
we've become like siblings,

11:06.700 --> 11:09.010
sharing joys and sorrows.

11:13.360 --> 11:15.030
Do you have someone you like?

11:16.750 --> 11:17.550
Tell me,

11:17.730 --> 11:19.190
I'll give you some advice.

11:19.960 --> 11:21.870
Someone I like?

11:24.000 --> 11:26.130
I think I might actually have someone.

11:27.870 --> 11:29.320
When I was little,

11:29.390 --> 11:30.850
I had a childhood friend.

11:30.910 --> 11:32.370
He was really good at painting.

11:32.370 --> 11:34.190
So I learned to paint too.

11:37.550 --> 11:38.150
And then?

11:38.550 --> 11:39.550
Then...

11:39.630 --> 11:41.600
Then he moved away, and that was it.

11:43.410 --> 11:44.270
What about you?

11:46.120 --> 11:46.750
Me?

11:48.240 --> 11:50.240
I... of course I had one too.

11:52.870 --> 11:53.670
It's just...

11:54.790 --> 11:56.250
Before I could even speak,

11:56.270 --> 11:57.730
she had already run away.

12:00.600 --> 12:01.440
Maybe...

12:02.760 --> 12:03.980
It wasn't meant to be.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.870
It's okay, Puppy Li.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.260
Don't be discouraged.

12:15.900 --> 12:17.050
This is for you.

12:18.200 --> 12:20.510
When you meet a girl you like in the future,

12:20.510 --> 12:22.000
give this to her.

12:25.350 --> 12:28.060
Did you make this yourself?

12:28.960 --> 12:30.320
Of course...

12:30.510 --> 12:31.600
Not.

12:32.240 --> 12:34.070
But I bought it myself.

12:34.090 --> 12:36.360
I saw it at the market and thought it was pretty.

12:36.360 --> 12:38.090
I thought I could give it to you.

12:40.170 --> 12:41.670
It's thoughtful, regardless.

12:41.670 --> 12:42.530
I'll accept it.

12:49.030 --> 12:50.360
I have a gift for you too.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.080
What is it?

12:51.630 --> 12:53.160
A teleportation talisman.

12:53.710 --> 12:55.510
If you encounter danger in the future,

12:55.510 --> 12:58.300
whether you're in a barrier or a magic array,

12:58.440 --> 12:59.840
activate this talisman,

12:59.840 --> 13:02.720
and it'll instantly teleport you 3 miles away.

13:05.840 --> 13:06.550
Thanks.

13:09.270 --> 13:09.960
Puppy Li,

13:14.870 --> 13:15.510
take care.

13:18.580 --> 13:19.710
Have a safe journey.

13:52.860 --> 13:53.650
Huaizhu.

13:56.540 --> 13:57.370
Father.

13:58.040 --> 13:59.700
Qinlan told me that you came up

14:00.120 --> 14:04.320
to this back mountain alone as soon as you returned.

14:06.150 --> 14:07.940
You're back at the manor,

14:08.600 --> 14:11.420
why didn't you come see me?

14:13.950 --> 14:15.410
Alright, alright.

14:16.720 --> 14:18.440
If you don't want to talk about it, that's fine.

14:18.440 --> 14:20.300
I'm just glad you're back safely.

14:21.570 --> 14:23.210
That girl Qinlan.

14:23.510 --> 14:24.910
As soon as she came through the door and saw me,

14:24.910 --> 14:27.150
she gave me a big, tight hug.

14:27.790 --> 14:30.510
I didn't even have time to say a few words to her.

14:30.630 --> 14:31.510
That girl.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.150
She immediately started fiddling with

14:33.150 --> 14:35.150
all the new things she brought back.

14:37.000 --> 14:41.200
You must have gained a lot from this journey.

14:45.240 --> 14:46.080
We...

14:49.030 --> 14:50.440
We saw Mother.

15:02.150 --> 15:03.030
So...

15:04.550 --> 15:06.390
You learned her story,

15:07.960 --> 15:09.020
and you also saw...

15:12.550 --> 15:14.120
You saw her shadow.

15:17.120 --> 15:17.750
Yes.

15:27.630 --> 15:28.490
Your mother...

15:31.000 --> 15:33.860
Is she still as beautiful as she was back then?

15:36.510 --> 15:38.120
If she saw me now...

15:39.380 --> 15:41.910
Father, your charm hasn't diminished at all.

15:44.330 --> 15:45.430
Really?

15:46.360 --> 15:47.200
Really.

15:49.360 --> 15:49.960
Good.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.630
Mother also said...

15:53.510 --> 15:54.510
She wanted us to

15:55.420 --> 15:56.620
give you a hug for her.

16:11.840 --> 16:12.610
Father,

16:14.440 --> 16:15.500
all these years,

16:17.120 --> 16:18.320
it's been hard on you.

16:29.670 --> 16:30.870
It wasn't hard for me.

16:33.240 --> 16:36.280
Seeing you two grow up happily,

16:38.030 --> 16:39.240
I'm content.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.920
Are you leaving now?

18:10.220 --> 18:12.480
From the day you entered Huntian Prison,

18:13.710 --> 18:15.840
I investigated everything about you.

18:17.350 --> 18:19.210
I determined that you were innocent.

18:19.210 --> 18:20.430
I also confirmed

18:21.080 --> 18:23.480
that you deliberately entered the prison.

18:25.880 --> 18:26.980
Soon,

18:27.390 --> 18:29.040
I figured out your purpose.

18:30.560 --> 18:32.160
You wanted to get close to me,

18:33.680 --> 18:34.590
to attract me.

18:37.380 --> 18:38.730
And the sad thing is,

18:40.340 --> 18:41.720
even though I knew this,

18:43.830 --> 18:45.650
I willingly fell into your trap.

18:53.490 --> 18:54.690
I also know

18:55.590 --> 18:57.420
that you're actually quite skilled,

18:57.420 --> 18:59.680
but you've been deliberately hiding it.

19:00.100 --> 19:00.970
So,

19:02.120 --> 19:04.560
I've been preparing something

19:05.440 --> 19:08.440
as a gift to propose to you.

19:10.250 --> 19:13.070
I observed the callus distribution on your right hand

19:13.070 --> 19:13.920
and thought

19:15.340 --> 19:16.670
you must be a sword user.

19:17.240 --> 19:19.210
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

19:18.350 --> 19:19.550
I want to tell you that

19:19.870 --> 19:22.210
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

19:22.430 --> 19:24.270
I won't ask about your background.

19:23.000 --> 19:26.550
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

19:25.510 --> 19:26.670
In front of me,

19:27.510 --> 19:32.190
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

19:28.160 --> 19:29.870
you only need to be yourself.

19:33.140 --> 19:37.160
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

19:35.990 --> 19:37.450
The sword is named Chuxue.

19:37.680 --> 19:40.350
I had planned to propose to you

19:38.250 --> 19:40.240
♪ We're fully committed ♪

19:40.790 --> 19:42.590
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

19:42.360 --> 19:43.630
on the first day of snow.

19:43.610 --> 19:47.500
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

19:47.960 --> 19:50.280
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

19:48.100 --> 19:49.760
But I have to leave.

19:50.790 --> 19:51.920
I'm indifferent to worldly affairs.

19:50.900 --> 19:53.130
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

19:53.130 --> 19:54.840
I can't promise you wealth and glory,

19:54.170 --> 19:58.260
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

19:55.830 --> 19:56.960
but I can promise you

19:57.790 --> 19:59.120
my undivided devotion.

20:00.460 --> 20:04.900
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

20:02.330 --> 20:04.530
I can provide a light for the night path,

20:05.190 --> 20:06.520
warmth for cold days,

20:05.540 --> 20:08.100
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

20:08.560 --> 20:10.520
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

20:08.940 --> 20:11.620
frozen plums in midsummer,

20:11.290 --> 20:13.120
♪ Time goes by ♪

20:12.620 --> 20:15.370
and a lamb hotpot when snow falls.

20:13.790 --> 20:15.680
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

20:15.420 --> 20:16.400
I said

20:16.510 --> 20:19.890
♪ But our love remains still ♪

20:19.750 --> 20:21.300
I'm leaving.

20:21.470 --> 20:25.850
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

20:26.730 --> 20:29.140
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

20:30.020 --> 20:31.920
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

20:31.980 --> 20:33.440
If you insist on leaving,

20:32.450 --> 20:34.090
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

20:34.670 --> 20:36.160
please take this sword as your companion.

20:34.860 --> 20:36.520
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

20:37.300 --> 20:40.890
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

20:38.320 --> 20:39.760
You only need to remember

20:40.560 --> 20:42.190
that someone sincerely

20:44.010 --> 20:46.160
wishes to light up your life's path.

20:48.510 --> 20:49.110
And

20:50.650 --> 20:52.520
he doesn't regret it at all.

21:02.600 --> 21:04.500
♪ We're fully committed ♪

21:05.140 --> 21:07.040
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

21:07.960 --> 21:11.850
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

21:12.310 --> 21:14.790
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

21:15.370 --> 21:17.540
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

21:18.520 --> 21:22.840
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

21:24.810 --> 21:29.250
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

21:29.890 --> 21:32.310
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

21:32.910 --> 21:34.870
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

21:35.640 --> 21:37.590
♪ Time goes by ♪

21:37.160 --> 21:38.550
The first snow is here.

21:38.350 --> 21:40.190
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

21:40.860 --> 21:44.240
♪ But our love remains still ♪

21:45.810 --> 21:47.510
What you said just now...

21:45.820 --> 21:50.200
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

21:49.920 --> 21:51.410
Does it still count?

21:50.940 --> 21:53.490
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

21:54.030 --> 21:56.040
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

21:56.500 --> 21:58.420
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

21:58.950 --> 22:00.870
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

22:01.460 --> 22:05.030
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

22:21.030 --> 22:22.350
I've grown old.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.820
My dear wife,

22:28.770 --> 22:30.860
thank you for staying

22:31.680 --> 22:33.200
for me back then,

22:35.270 --> 22:37.030
and for giving me

22:37.780 --> 22:40.210
two such wonderful daughters.

22:44.960 --> 22:46.600
My dear wife,

22:45.190 --> 22:49.340
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

22:49.070 --> 22:51.190
don't go too far.

22:50.500 --> 22:52.910
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

22:53.540 --> 22:55.580
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

22:54.150 --> 22:55.780
Remember to wait for me.

22:56.150 --> 22:57.760
♪ The past vanishes ♪

22:58.390 --> 23:00.130
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

22:58.440 --> 22:59.680
Wait for me...

23:00.880 --> 23:04.880
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

23:23.980 --> 23:26.910
I'm the first to arrive at the gathering again today.

23:34.510 --> 23:37.890
All the world is muddy, I alone am clear.

23:38.030 --> 23:38.920
The masses...

23:39.830 --> 23:40.640
The masses...

23:41.240 --> 23:42.790
What was it about the masses again?

23:42.790 --> 23:44.920
The masses are drunk, I alone remain sober.

23:44.920 --> 23:46.750
You talk so much despite your lack of education.

23:46.750 --> 23:48.640
But you need to say the secret code first.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.770
What secret code?

23:49.880 --> 23:51.030
Are we that close?

24:00.510 --> 24:01.240
Zui,

24:01.590 --> 24:03.390
you aren't following the rules.

24:04.090 --> 24:06.800
Oh, it's the young and early-married Qiyue.

24:07.160 --> 24:08.790
Not staying home to take care of your child?

24:08.790 --> 24:10.160
Why are you here for a rendezvous?

24:10.160 --> 24:12.130
Hongye told us to gather here.

24:12.510 --> 24:13.400
Our gathering at the Sky-breaking Temple

24:13.400 --> 24:15.000
is becoming more and more undisciplined.

24:15.000 --> 24:17.800
Only Qiyue still insists on using the secret code.

24:18.270 --> 24:19.470
That's commendable.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.640
Yitan is right.

24:21.310 --> 24:22.640
We are an organization.

24:22.810 --> 24:25.070
- An organization has its own rules.
- Hongye.

24:25.070 --> 24:26.030
Qingmu.

24:26.140 --> 24:26.890
Zui.

24:29.130 --> 24:30.920
Our gathering password this time:

24:30.920 --> 24:32.710
Unveil the mask of the world.

24:35.070 --> 24:35.680
Hongye,

24:35.820 --> 24:38.510
why aren't you wearing the mask Sister-in-law gave you?

24:38.510 --> 24:39.640
Then I'll change it.

24:42.130 --> 24:44.390
What did you all experience this time?

24:44.720 --> 24:45.980
We experienced...

24:46.790 --> 24:47.680
Growth.

25:08.910 --> 25:10.530
As expected of my sister-in-law.

25:10.530 --> 25:13.660
My brother finally has the demeanor of a sword immortal.

25:21.630 --> 25:23.310
I just changed a mask,

25:23.440 --> 25:24.800
what's the big deal?

25:25.400 --> 25:26.270
He's

25:26.270 --> 25:27.510
showing off his love.

25:31.860 --> 25:33.140
Now, let's begin.

25:33.590 --> 25:35.520
I have a few announcements to make.

25:35.640 --> 25:36.170
Alright.

25:36.270 --> 25:37.000
First,

25:37.270 --> 25:38.270
the Mask Group

25:38.810 --> 25:40.670
has a new member joining us today.

25:51.570 --> 25:52.920
Dark Sword Zhang Zheng.

25:54.710 --> 25:55.530
Yuan,

25:55.720 --> 25:56.750
he couldn't have come all this way

25:56.750 --> 25:58.350
just to pursue you, could he?

26:05.350 --> 26:06.200
I'm here

26:06.570 --> 26:07.400
to join you.

26:10.030 --> 26:11.470
Join us?

26:11.830 --> 26:13.460
Shouldn't you ask what we do

26:13.550 --> 26:14.950
before asking to join us?

26:15.170 --> 26:16.170
He said you want to

26:17.090 --> 26:18.570
prevent conflicts between humans and demons,

26:18.570 --> 26:21.070
break the darkness, and eliminate the Black Fox.

26:21.070 --> 26:22.800
Although the goal seems vague,

26:23.440 --> 26:24.500
Yuan is here.

26:25.350 --> 26:26.750
I believe it's possible.

26:28.590 --> 26:31.050
Dark Sword Zhang Zheng, slayer of darkness.

26:31.270 --> 26:32.180
Starting today,

26:32.180 --> 26:33.840
you're part of the Mask Group,

26:33.910 --> 26:35.120
ranking eighth.

26:35.510 --> 26:36.510
Welcome, junior.

26:59.520 --> 27:01.790
[Zhang Zheng Of Mask Group]

27:05.100 --> 27:07.360
It's slightly prettier than I imagined.

27:08.400 --> 27:09.590
Qingmu,

27:09.960 --> 27:12.740
you've won over Master Zhang Zheng.

27:12.770 --> 27:14.250
It was a piece of cake.

27:15.290 --> 27:17.230
Now, I'll announce the second matter.

27:17.230 --> 27:19.140
During this journey to the Beast Kingdom,

27:19.140 --> 27:21.470
I've found a way to deal with the Black Fox.

27:21.510 --> 27:22.850
The Black Fox thrives on hatred,

27:22.850 --> 27:24.090
its power is astonishing.

27:24.090 --> 27:25.770
If we want to eliminate the Black Fox,

27:25.770 --> 27:28.110
we must stop the conflict between humans and demons.

27:28.110 --> 27:29.320
The Yiqi Alliance

27:29.860 --> 27:31.990
is due for a complete transformation.

27:54.850 --> 27:55.710
Come out.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.170
Senior Renfeng.

28:05.550 --> 28:06.640
It's late at night.

28:06.640 --> 28:07.640
Why have you returned?

28:07.640 --> 28:09.970
Shouldn't I be the one asking you that?

28:10.240 --> 28:12.100
During these days when I was away,

28:12.460 --> 28:15.060
what have you been sneaking around doing here?

28:15.350 --> 28:17.280
Senior Renfeng, I was actually...

28:19.000 --> 28:19.500
Senior,

28:19.680 --> 28:20.960
I was wrong! I was wrong!

28:20.960 --> 28:22.020
Please forgive me this time.

28:22.020 --> 28:23.440
Please forgive me, Senior.

28:23.440 --> 28:25.370
The last time you stole something,

28:25.550 --> 28:27.150
what did the Master tell you?

28:27.400 --> 28:29.130
Have you forgotten so quickly?

28:29.440 --> 28:30.200
Senior Renfeng,

28:30.200 --> 28:31.960
you absolutely cannot tell the Master about this.

28:31.960 --> 28:34.090
He will surely expel me from the villa.

28:34.310 --> 28:35.870
Senior, Senior!

28:35.890 --> 28:36.790
Senior!

28:48.200 --> 28:50.060
It's just a bit of money, isn't it?

28:54.830 --> 28:55.510
Senior.

28:55.820 --> 28:56.400
Take it.

29:00.750 --> 29:01.440
Dong,

29:03.160 --> 29:04.640
I know you love to gamble,

29:05.640 --> 29:08.170
and I know you're not content being a servant.

29:09.350 --> 29:10.640
You're like me,

29:11.590 --> 29:13.510
we're both ambitious people.

29:15.790 --> 29:16.790
Follow me closely and

29:16.790 --> 29:17.790
obey my orders.

29:18.480 --> 29:21.410
In the future, the chief steward of Divine Fire Villa

29:24.000 --> 29:25.110
will be you.

29:30.960 --> 29:32.020
Mr. Fei,

29:32.350 --> 29:34.550
you've brought me five meals in one day.

29:34.900 --> 29:36.030
Is something wrong?

29:36.960 --> 29:38.590
You've often been away from home recently.

29:38.590 --> 29:39.920
I've been at a loose end.

29:41.740 --> 29:42.980
Oh, Young Master,

29:43.590 --> 29:45.900
your 26th birthday is approaching.

29:46.070 --> 29:47.270
Do you have any plans?

29:47.270 --> 29:48.200
Mr. Fei,

29:48.960 --> 29:50.090
I'm suddenly tired.

29:51.550 --> 29:52.350
Alright.

30:00.160 --> 30:01.830
Mr. Fei, Mr. Fei.

30:04.200 --> 30:04.830
Mr. Fei,

30:04.830 --> 30:07.640
what did my brother say about his birthday?

30:08.310 --> 30:09.590
As always.

30:11.350 --> 30:12.480
It's been ten years.

30:12.790 --> 30:14.790
Why is my brother still so stubborn?

30:14.920 --> 30:17.050
He refuses to celebrate his birthday.

30:17.680 --> 30:18.880
Nothing is absolute.

30:19.550 --> 30:22.310
Actually, the person who can light up Hongye's heart

30:22.310 --> 30:23.640
has already appeared.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.160
That's right!

30:26.160 --> 30:27.560
We can ask Mrs. Wangquan.

30:27.750 --> 30:28.350
Let's go.

30:29.550 --> 30:30.240
We're off.

30:31.340 --> 30:33.000
Let's notify the others while we're at it.

30:33.000 --> 30:35.440
It'll be better if it's lively and bustling.

30:35.440 --> 30:36.920
Ah, young people.

30:51.310 --> 30:52.000
Zui?

30:55.440 --> 30:56.370
Sister-in-law,

30:56.400 --> 30:57.510
you know my brother,

30:57.510 --> 30:58.550
he's just a quiet person.

30:58.550 --> 31:00.750
He likes to keep everything to himself.

31:01.000 --> 31:04.400
Every year, we really want to celebrate his birthday for him.

31:05.550 --> 31:09.070
Actually, I think as long as he's happy, that's all that matters.

31:09.070 --> 31:10.670
If he really doesn't want to,

31:10.880 --> 31:12.210
we shouldn't force him.

31:12.350 --> 31:13.880
But this year is different.

31:14.030 --> 31:15.440
We have you now, sister-in-law.

31:15.440 --> 31:17.440
Why don't we give it a try?

31:22.160 --> 31:23.220
Sister-in-law...

31:35.270 --> 31:36.400
Unless it's urgent,

31:36.550 --> 31:37.950
please leave me be today.

31:38.590 --> 31:39.390
What's wrong?

31:39.510 --> 31:40.440
Am I not welcome?

31:47.350 --> 31:48.550
What brings you here?

31:49.240 --> 31:50.920
It's my first time at Wangquan Manor.

31:50.920 --> 31:53.440
Shouldn't Young Master Wangquan be a good host

31:53.440 --> 31:54.400
and show me around?

31:54.400 --> 31:55.270
Of course.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.200
Hongye,

32:19.750 --> 32:23.080
why haven't you celebrated your birthday for so many years?

32:27.390 --> 32:29.050
I've been waiting for someone

32:29.300 --> 32:38.620
[Unparalleled Sword]

32:30.590 --> 32:32.020
and a belated blessing.

32:45.200 --> 32:45.960
Father,

32:49.230 --> 32:50.230
you called for me?

32:54.270 --> 32:55.730
I never thought you'd have

32:55.960 --> 32:58.640
your coming-of-age ceremony so soon.

33:00.030 --> 33:01.560
It's still three days away.

33:02.880 --> 33:03.440
Yes.

33:04.480 --> 33:06.540
I've memorized the ceremony speech.

33:08.110 --> 33:10.040
Now that the ceremony is complete,

33:10.200 --> 33:11.640
I hope from this day forward...

33:11.640 --> 33:12.310
Father,

33:12.640 --> 33:15.270
you should save those words for three days later

33:15.270 --> 33:17.730
when you personally place the cap on my head.

33:19.440 --> 33:20.320
You're right.

33:21.350 --> 33:22.610
I'm getting confused.

33:23.070 --> 33:24.530
I'll wait for you to return

33:25.030 --> 33:26.310
to perform my coming-of-age ceremony

33:26.310 --> 33:27.840
and celebrate my birthday.

33:30.690 --> 33:31.370
Alright.

33:37.480 --> 33:39.400
So this blessing for the coming-of-age ceremony

33:39.400 --> 33:40.800
became a knot in my heart.

33:42.160 --> 33:43.110
Of course,

33:43.570 --> 33:44.840
it was also to keep

33:45.290 --> 33:47.690
the hope that my father could still return.

33:55.680 --> 33:56.650
However,

33:57.620 --> 33:59.590
though I lost a family member,

33:59.960 --> 34:00.750
now

34:01.480 --> 34:03.690
I have the Mask Group as my new family,

34:06.130 --> 34:06.820
and you.

34:08.840 --> 34:11.000
So when I think about it, all of this

34:13.120 --> 34:14.719
is truly worth celebrating.

34:18.469 --> 34:20.030
Have you all finished listening?

34:20.030 --> 34:22.710
If you don't come out now, there won't be any food left

34:22.710 --> 34:23.639
or wine to drink.

34:47.810 --> 34:48.560
Hongye,

34:49.040 --> 34:51.330
when did you notice us?

34:51.440 --> 34:53.300
Next time, hide your feet better.

34:54.530 --> 34:56.880
My brother and I hid pretty well, didn't we?

34:56.880 --> 34:58.760
Who wears red clothes when hiding?

34:58.760 --> 34:59.450
Hongye,

34:59.760 --> 35:01.840
I did well turning into a rock, right?

35:01.920 --> 35:03.670
You think I wouldn't notice a new rock

35:03.670 --> 35:05.470
in our courtyard out of nowhere?

35:06.540 --> 35:07.410
And you, Yitan.

35:08.400 --> 35:10.730
You must have encouraged Huaizhu, right?

35:11.010 --> 35:11.990
No,

35:12.630 --> 35:15.160
we just had the same idea as Mrs. Wangquan.

35:18.110 --> 35:19.510
What about the other two?

35:20.400 --> 35:22.280
Although they couldn't make it here,

35:22.280 --> 35:23.610
they prepared the food.

35:26.230 --> 35:27.800
Since the mood is set,

35:27.840 --> 35:30.440
let me first wish my brother, Young Master Wangquan...

35:30.440 --> 35:32.000
A year older, a year wiser.

35:32.000 --> 35:32.960
With an extra inch of joy.

35:32.960 --> 35:35.510
Happy birthday.

35:36.110 --> 35:36.760
Come on.

35:42.190 --> 35:43.070
Well,

35:44.230 --> 35:45.490
where are my presents?

36:01.740 --> 36:04.470
My first birthday celebration after so many years,

36:04.470 --> 36:06.070
and there are no gifts for me?

36:07.580 --> 36:08.340
Hongye,

36:08.510 --> 36:10.710
you didn't say you wanted to celebrate.

36:18.210 --> 36:20.540
So all of this

36:21.230 --> 36:22.750
isn't the gift you wanted?

36:28.030 --> 36:28.920
Let's go then.

36:31.660 --> 36:33.180
Whose side are you on?

36:33.230 --> 36:35.560
Hongye, look at you.

36:36.110 --> 36:37.250
You're allowed to surprise me,

36:37.250 --> 36:38.780
but I can't give you a scare?

36:40.230 --> 36:40.890
Never mind.

36:41.000 --> 36:41.940
Don't blame my brother anymore.

36:41.940 --> 36:43.280
Come on, sister-in-law,

36:43.280 --> 36:44.740
let's have another drink.

36:45.440 --> 36:45.940
Qiyue.

36:47.210 --> 36:50.110
Hongye, do you have any good wine hidden away?

36:50.300 --> 36:51.180
I want to drink.

36:51.710 --> 36:52.800
I'll drink everything.

36:52.800 --> 36:53.930
I'll go get it.

36:53.950 --> 36:55.280
There's plenty of wine.

36:55.280 --> 36:58.710
Tonight, we won't leave until we're drunk.

36:58.840 --> 36:59.760
Come on, cheers.

36:59.760 --> 37:01.620
We won't leave until we're drunk.

38:01.880 --> 38:02.630
Thank you.

38:05.280 --> 38:06.590
I'm very happy today.

38:07.800 --> 38:08.670
Me too.

38:18.510 --> 38:19.640
Wait for me a moment.

38:29.280 --> 38:31.050
[Betrothal Letter]

38:30.440 --> 38:31.190
Look.

38:39.760 --> 38:40.440
Huaizhu.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.570
I've made up my mind.

38:43.400 --> 38:45.930
Once we've resolved the current major issue,

38:46.110 --> 38:47.770
I'll come to propose marriage

38:48.550 --> 38:49.750
to take you as my wife.

38:50.720 --> 38:53.010
♪ The night breeze is gentle ♪

38:52.760 --> 38:54.000
The wedding date is set on

38:53.840 --> 38:56.480
♪ Rushing the sunset into dream ♪

38:54.550 --> 38:55.950
July 7th, how about that?

38:57.430 --> 38:59.950
♪ The fireflies fly in the night sky ♪

38:58.980 --> 39:03.800
[Betrothal Letter]

39:02.390 --> 39:04.430
♪ The wine warms my throat ♪

39:05.220 --> 39:08.080
♪ The lake is wrinkled ♪

39:06.320 --> 39:07.800
That's fine.

39:09.150 --> 39:10.230
But...

39:09.450 --> 39:12.370
♪ Waiting for you to dock by the riverside ♪

39:10.600 --> 39:11.400
But what?

39:12.020 --> 39:14.150
But what kind of betrothal letter uses

39:14.190 --> 39:15.960
black ink on white paper?

39:14.550 --> 39:17.580
♪ With appropriate makeup ♪

39:17.000 --> 39:20.110
And this betrothal letter is too ugly.

39:17.860 --> 39:21.070
[Betrothal Letter]

39:19.740 --> 39:22.800
♪ Even gentler than the moon ♪

39:21.230 --> 39:22.280
I have a few more here.

39:22.280 --> 39:23.140
Take a look.

39:24.400 --> 39:26.350
[Betrothal Letter]

39:24.700 --> 39:26.130
♪ Though I haven't gotten close to you ♪

39:26.660 --> 39:28.410
♪ My heart is already fluttering ♪

39:29.480 --> 39:34.430
♪ Just like a dream of midsummer ♪

39:30.510 --> 39:32.300
Why are there so many?

39:33.440 --> 39:34.530
Because I've never written one before,

39:34.530 --> 39:35.730
so I wrote a few extra.

39:35.930 --> 39:38.650
Of course, you know my poor taste.

39:37.340 --> 39:39.480
♪ In the forest ♪

39:39.950 --> 39:41.950
♪ Wine drops fall ♪

39:40.710 --> 39:41.510
This one...

39:41.530 --> 39:42.540
How is it?

39:42.740 --> 39:44.940
♪ At the tip of my heart ♪

39:42.750 --> 39:43.990
The format is wrong.

39:44.110 --> 39:45.170
How about this one?

39:45.470 --> 39:47.400
♪ Face blushing ♪

39:48.230 --> 39:50.080
♪ Hands fiddling ♪

39:51.120 --> 39:52.740
♪ Clothes soaked wet ♪

39:53.280 --> 39:54.280
No good?

39:53.380 --> 39:55.450
♪ The wine diminishing ♪

39:55.590 --> 39:56.320
This one?

39:56.140 --> 39:57.580
♪ Love is getting deeper ♪

39:58.770 --> 40:00.990
♪ The full moon rises ♪
